flowchart LR
  Agent[Coding agent] --> Repo[Local repo]
  Agent --> MCP[MCP or Composio tools]

  MCP --> GitHub[GitHub]
  MCP --> Email[Email]
  MCP --> Calendar[Calendar]
  MCP --> Browser[Browser]

  Repo --> Env[Local env files]
  Env -. secrets stay local .-> Agent

  Email -. untrusted content .-> Agent
  Browser -. untrusted content .-> Agent
  GitHub -. issues and comments are untrusted content .-> Agent

  Agent --> Confirm{External mutation?}
  Confirm -->|yes| Ask[Ask or dry-run first]
  Confirm -->|no| Read[Read-only inspection]

